  "verseCount": 29,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "29",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 29"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "29",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkomelejiwa kūdima ilagane",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī mihayo īyī hū yene ī yilagane īlo SEEBA akanagīla Musa kūbeeja na Baisilaeli, aho balī mu sī ya Moabu; kūlīleka ī lilagane īlo akabeeja nabo balī kū lūgūlū lwa Holebu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Musa ūbitana pye a Baisilaeli ūbawīla, “Ng'wībona na miso ging'we pyī īyo SEEBA akīyīta mu Misili kūlī Falao na batūmami bakwe, nī sī yakwe ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Miso gako bebe ng'wenekīlī gībona ī mihayo ya kūluhya kūtaale nī yīngī ī ya kūkamaaja; gūshibona nī shimanīkījo sha kūkumya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo nahene kūshisha lelo īyī ū SEEBA ataalī ū kūkwinha a masala ga kwitegeleja, nūūlū a miso ayo gadūgije kūbona, na a matū ayo gadūgije kwigwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu myaka makūmi anè ī yose īyo naamutongeelile ng'witogolo ūmu, ī shizwalo shing'we shitashilile, pyī nūūlū ī shilatū sha kū mhambala jing'we shitashilile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutalile ngatī gose gose, nūūlū sha kūng'wa shose shose sha kūmukola mutang'wile ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo. Ī yenīyī nakayīta gīkī mumane ū nene hū nalī SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho ng'washika a hipandī lyenīlī ū Sihoni ū ntemi wa Heshiboni, nū Ogi ū ntemi wa Bashani, bakiza kūtūdumīla kwilwisha būlūgū nise, alīyo tūbapyena. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Twīsola ī sī yabo tūbinha ba ng'anda ja ba Lubeni na Gadi, na nusu ya lūganda lwa Manase, yūbiza wingīji wabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū itegelejagi gete, ng'wīdime ī mihayo ya ilagane lyenīlī, mūdūle kūpandīka ū mu yose īyo mulayīte. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lelo yenīyī ng'wīmīīlaga a bose kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we; batongeeji ba ng'anda, bataale ba kaya, banamhala, bagunanhi, na a Baisilaeli a bangī a bose; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hamò na a bana bing'we na a bake bing'we, na a bageni abo bakwikalaga mu bing'we kūlwa kūmupandūlīla ng'hwi na kūmudahīla minzī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wīmīīlaga aha kūlwa kūbeeja ilagane nū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, ilagane īlo SEEBA alībeeja ning'we ī lelo mu kūlahīla ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gīkī ī lelo yenīyī alīng'wīta mubize banhū bakwe, nū wei abize Mulungu wing'we, gīt'ūmo wang'wisagīīgīja, na gīt'ūmo wabilahīlīla a bakūlūgenji bing'we, ba Abulahamu, Isaka, na Yakobo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lilagane lyenīlī nī shilahīlo shalyo natūbeejaga na bing'we dūhū, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abo ng'wīmīīlaga hamò nise aha, kū būtongi bo ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wise, alīyo na a babo batīho hamò nise aha ī lelo īyī.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gūlīho nsango ūlū ūneka Mulungu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we benekīlī mumanile ūmo twikalīlaga ū mu sī ya Misili, nū mumo tūkajibītīla ī sī ījo tūkajibīta kūshisha tūshika aha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'wagabona a mashikolo gabo ga malofu, a mashiikolile ga mantī na ga mawe, ga feza na ga zahabu ayo galīmo ū mu sī jabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ilang'hanagi atizigela munhū ose ose, ngosha nūūlū nkīma; nūūlū lūtizūbiza ho lūganda nūūlū kaya ndebe ū mu bing'we abo mulīho aha lelo īyī, atizigela wa kūgalūcha ng'holò yakwe aneke ū SEEBA Mulungu wise, aje kūbalamya bamulungu ba mahanga genayo. Lang'hanagi gete lītizigela ijinji lyose lyose ū mu bing'we īlo līshikile kūfuluma na kūtwaja matwajo ga būsūngū wabūbi gīko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū wa gīko ashikile kwīyigwa ī mihayo ya shilahīlo shenīshi hūna wandya kwikumīlīja wei ng'wenekīlī akwiwīlaga, “Natūbiza kanhū, nūūlū īkī nataalī nakūjaga na yane dūhū nane.” Ī liganiko lyenīlo lyabūbi no, nguno līkwenheleja būkenaagūji hose pyī ū mu sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA atalanekeja ū munhū wa gīko, ū būpelanu nū wilu wakwe būkūbaka no ū kūlī munhū ng'wenūyo. Pye a mazumo ayo gandīkilwe ū mu shitabo shenīshi gakūngwīla, ū SEEBA akūlījimya gete ī lina lyakwe lyīnge a ha sīlīlī y'igūlū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū SEEBA akūnkomanya ū munhū ng'wenūyo kūfuma ū mu ng'anda ja Baisilaeli, ankenaagūle kūlenganīla na a mazumo g'ilagane a gose, ayo gandīkilwe ū mu shitabo sha shilagīlo shenīshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bana bing'we abo bakūmulondeela mu shikū ja shibyalīlwe sha hanuma, na a bageni abo bakwiza kūfuma sī ja kūle bakūgabona a makoye ayo gayīgwīla ī sī, na a mabūsaatu ayo wayenhela ū SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pyī ī sī īkūbiza gītī mbūga yitīīlilwe munhu, gītī ītiimilwe moto na būgota wa shibiliti; nguno shikūbiza shitahambilwe shose shose. Ndūhū gete īsho shikahambagwa, ndūhū ho nūūlū kī ū mu shose īsho shikazwaga. Ū būkenaagūji wene būkūbiza gīt'ūmo walī wa Sodoma na Gomola, hamò na Adima na Zeboimu, mizengo īyo SEEBA akīkenaagūlū kūlwa būpelanu wakwe būtaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pye a mahanga gakūyibūūja, “Nibūlī ū SEEBA wayītīlile mhayo gītī gwenūyū ī sī īyī? Ū būpelanu ū būtaale wenūbū būlī na makūlū kī?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī lishosho līkūbiza, “Īlī kūlwa nguno a banhū benaba baalīleka ī lilagane lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wa bakūlūgenji babo, ī lilagane īlo akabeeja nabo aho alībenha kūfuma Misili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakandya kūlamya bamulungu bangī, būyūbinamīla na kūbinamīla; bamulungu abo baalī batabamanile, bamulungu abo walī atabinhile wei. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.29.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.29.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 29:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene ū būpelanu bo ng'wa SEEBA wabakile gīko ū kū sī yenīyī, kūshisha nose wīyenhelile pye a mazumo ayo gandīkilwe ū mu shitabo shenīshi. ",
          "type": "text",
